    >
      will select {{ selectionSummary.count }} summaries merged into one {{ levelLabel(selectionSummary.level) }}(Ignore the automatic summary threshold).
      The original summary will be included in the new summary and removed from the list (the data will not be deleted, but the new summary can be deleted and restored). Continue?
    </ConfirmDialog>

    <!-- 批量删除确认:选中总结代表整段历史,会连同其收纳的下层节点永久删除。 -->
    <ConfirmDialog
